                     ━━━ PREAMBLE ━━━

This software was created with the vision of advancing decentralized
AI verification technology for the benefit of society. It is shared
openly so that developers, researchers, and students may learn from
it, contribute to it, and build upon it — but only for ethical and
lawful purposes.


